      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 13 Boroimhe Hazel to the Swords property market. This superb three-bedroom home offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families, or those seeking a spacious and well-located property.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, the entrance hall leads into the spacious living room. Double doors provide access to the large kitchen/dining area, which offers excellent space for both everyday living and entertaining. The ground floor is further complemented by a utility room and a convenient guest WC located beneath the stairs.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with en-suite, along with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nBoroimhe is a well-established development, ideally located close to a wide range of local amenities and schools. SuperValu and The Pavilions Shopping Centre are within easy reach, while Dublin Airport is also conveniently located nearby. The area is well served by numerous transport links, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
